{"unit_id":"tag:070N:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为复形（complex），由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成。范畴（category）<MATH_0004> 有足够多的内射对象（enough injectives），因此可使用《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0001> 构造图（diagram）\n<MATH_0005>\n在范畴（category）中，其对象为复形（complexes），由 <MATH_0006>-模（modules）组成，使得\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 竖直箭头（arrows）为拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms），\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0007> 为下有界（bounded below）复形（complex），由内射对象（injectives）组成，\n<STRUCT_0005> 箭头（arrows）<MATH_0008> 为逐项（termwise）分裂（split）的满射（surjections）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n范畴（category），由 <MATH_0009>-模（modules）组成的，有极限（limits）（在预层（presheaves）的层次上计算），因此可构造逐项（termwise）极限（limit）<MATH_0010>。由《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>，这是 K-内射（injective）复形（complex）。一般而言，典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0011>\n未必是拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。下面的引理描述它具有此性质的一些条件。\n\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"enough injectives","target_term":"足够多的内射对象"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"下有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target