{"unit_id":"tag:070Q:statement","translation":"在上文所述情形中，以 <MATH_0001> 表示第 <MATH_0002> 次上同调（cohomology）层（sheaf）。设 <MATH_0003> 为子集（subset）。设 <MATH_0004>。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 每个对象（object），属于 <MATH_0005> 的，都有覆盖（covering），其成员为 <MATH_0006> 的元素（elements），\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个 <MATH_0007>，有 <MATH_0008>，对 <MATH_0009> 和 <MATH_0010><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>只需 <MATH_0011>、<MATH_0012>、<MATH_0013> 对 <MATH_0014> 成立，见引理 <REF_0001>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则 (<REF_0002>) 为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"待消解复形的上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"覆盖基对象"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖基条件"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"覆盖的成员"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"到 K-内射消解的比较"}],"notes":["原文脚注公式中的 U. 原字节保留，未将其改为逗号。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:070Q:proof","translation":"由《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0001>，只需证明映射（map）\n<MATH_0001>\n为同构（isomorphism）。这由引理 <REF_0002> 得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"到截断的导出极限"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"比较映射的性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:070N:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面给出一个技术引理，讨论上同调层（cohomology sheaves），对应于逐项（termwise）极限（limits），取自逆系统（inverse systems），由复形（complexes）组成，各项为模（modules）。应尽可能避免使用这一引理，转而使用涉及导出（derived）逆（inverse）极限（limits）的论证。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"inverse systems","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"derived","target_term":"导出"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层","context":"极限复形的上同调层"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项","context":"按复形次数取极限"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限","context":"逐项极限及导出逆极限"},{"source_term":"inverse systems","target_term":"逆系统","context":"复形的系统"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"系统各项"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形系数"},{"source_term":"derived","target_term":"导出","context":"导出逆极限"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"此处与 limits 合成逆极限"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08CT:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为逆系统（inverse system），由复形（complexes）组成，其各项为 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）。设 <MATH_0004>。假设给定 <MATH_0005> 和整数（integer）<MATH_0006>，使得\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 每个对象（object），属于 <MATH_0007> 的，都有覆盖（covering），其成员为 <MATH_0008> 的元素（elements），\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个 <MATH_0009>，\n<STRUCT_0004>\n<STRUCT_0005> 系统（systems），由阿贝尔群（abelian groups）<MATH_0010> 和 <MATH_0011> 组成的，其 <MATH_0012> 消失（vanishing）（例如它们具有 Mittag-Leffler 性质（Mittag-Leffler property）），\n<STRUCT_0006> 系统（system），由阿贝尔群（abelian groups）<MATH_0013> 组成的，其 <MATH_0014> 消失（vanishing）（例如它具有 Mittag-Leffler 性质（Mittag-Leffler property）），且\n<STRUCT_0007> 有\n<MATH_0015>\n对所有 <MATH_0016> 成立。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009>\n则映射（maps）<MATH_0017> 为同构（isomorphisms），在层（sheaves）之间，其中 <MATH_0018> 为逐项（termwise）逆（inverse）极限（limit）。 \n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"systems","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"Mittag-Leffler property","target_term":"Mittag-Leffler 性质"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"Mittag-Leffler property","target_term":"Mittag-Leffler 性质"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"}],"unknown_