{"unit_id":"tag:08CT:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001>。注意 <MATH_0002> 是上同调（cohomology），对应于\n<MATH_0003>\n从左数第三个位置。由假设 (2)(a) 和 (2)(b)，可以应用《代数进阶（More on Algebra）》引理 <REF_0001>，得到\n<MATH_0004>\n由假设 (2)(c)，得到\n<MATH_0005>\n对所有 <MATH_0006>。由假设 (1)，得到 <MATH_0007> 的层化（sheafification）等于 <MATH_0008> 的层化（sheafification），对所有 <MATH_0009>。于是逆系统（inverse system），由层（sheaves）<MATH_0010> 组成的，为常值（constant），对 <MATH_0011>，其值为 <MATH_0012>，这就证明了引理。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"More on Algebra","target_term":"代数进阶"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"截面复形的上同调"},{"source_term":"More on Algebra","target_term":"代数进阶","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"局部上同调预层与层"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统","context":"上同调层的系统"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值","context":"指标足够大后系统的常值性"}],"notes":[]}
